held $PROJECT/free
unlocked $PROJECT/free
free.lock is gone
# 2 a live lock of another process: NoWait gives busy and leaves the dir (point 1)
busy $PROJECT/live
live.lock is kept
# 3 a stale beat (more than 30 s): the next process takes it, with NoWait and with Wait (point 2)
held $PROJECT/old
unlocked $PROJECT/old
held $PROJECT/oldw
unlocked $PROJECT/oldw
# 4 no beat file: the age of the directory counts
held $PROJECT/nb_old
unlocked $PROJECT/nb_old
busy $PROJECT/nb_new
nb_new.lock is kept
# 5 the first run: the directory of the item does not exist yet
held $PROJECT/deep/er/item
unlocked $PROJECT/deep/er/item
parent dirs made, item.lock is gone
# 6 two locks in one process: the second is busy, and the first is released (the reverse order)
held $PROJECT/x
busy $PROJECT/live2
unlocked $PROJECT/x
